+/**
+ * Regression test for CVE-2026-45367 (CWE-1333, Inefficient Regular Expression
+ * Complexity / ReDoS).
+ *
+ * HAPI FHIR's FHIRPathEngine passed user-controlled regular expressions from the
+ * matches() and replaceMatches() FHIRPath functions to the Java regex engine
+ * without any timeout, allowing catastrophic backtracking to exhaust CPU. The fix
+ * caps regex evaluation time (default 500ms) and throws a PathEngineException on
+ * timeout.
